      467.52,
      310.03,
      549.59
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 1 allotments in total extent of about 0.0147 Hectare,of land in Preliminary Plan No. G4066 and dated 05.03.2014prepared by the Sinior - Superintendent of Survey of GalleDictric on behalf of Survey General, situated in the GramaNiladhari Division of No. 193E, Nugethota in the village ofWelivitiya in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Welivitiya -Divithura in Galle District in the Southern Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
